
Ranger Help for: learn
======================

SYNTAX:      learn <skill name here>/learn cost for <skill name here>
USAGE:       Any wilderness terrain.

SUMMARY:    
Allows a Ranger to learn a skill from the slots list providing the Ranger
has enough slots available and enough experience. If you type 'learn cost
for <skill>', you will see the cost of learning that skill in slots and
experience points and how many you have of each currently.

============================================================================
SEE ALSO: slots, myinfo and myskills
